        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude-crib" ana="#fromLatin" corresp="#wit-du">O God, who for the three boys tempered the flames of [fire], grant, we beseech you, that the flame of vices may not burn us, your servants! Through …</ab>
